{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03106","headline":"故荥阳君苏氏挽歌词三首 一 · 张九龄","name":"故荥阳君苏氏挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门绪公侯列，嫔风诗礼行。\n松萝方有寄，桃李忽无成。\n剑去双龙别，雏哀九凤鸣。\n何言峄山树，还似半心生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}